/*
 * Test: Four nodes and a branch in between all nodes to get a maximally
 * complex structure of the LES.
 *
 * Check:
 * - R4 must not impact G
 * - Due to symmetry and if R3/R6 = R5/R1, then G=R6/(R3+R6)=R5/(R1+R5).
 *
 * Copyright (C) 2013 Peter Vranken
 */

U U1  K3  K1
U U2  K2  gnd


R R3  \
  K3  \
  K2
R R2  K2  K1
R R6  K2  gnd
R R1  K1  gnd
R R5  K3  K1
R R4  K3  gnd

DEF   Uout K1 K2
RES   msResult Uout LIN 30 10. 10M
